{"id":1745080,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-08T11:49:04.351Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1745080,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Mimpi Yang Sempurna","overview":"# Perfect Dreams  A story of a woman's struggle to overcome the ego of a man who is also her supervisor at work, which eventually sparks the seeds of love. Wardah works as an assistant to a senior manager named Haiman. Haiman is a widower known for his hot-tempered attitude in treating his workers, including Wardah, coldly. Wardah feels she is a victim of Haiman's bullying as he gives her many tasks, often causing her to come home late. After receiving advice from Mak Uda, Wardah returns with enthusiasm to work and even plans to change Haiman's attitude. Haiman becomes increasingly strict with Wardah's work and pressures her to attend meetings with him. Wardah shares her problems with her best friend, Yasmeen. Haiman suddenly begins treating Wardah kindly. His demeanor becomes cheerful with Wardah's presence by his side. Meanwhile, Wardah's parents begin asking about her relationship with her fiancé, Adib, whose behavior seems cold.","popularity":0.0286,"poster_path":"/5YNIPrajpzS5akkSzvRa17JTrr5.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":92215,"logo_path":null,"name":"Zamriez Golden Pictures Sdn Bhd","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2019-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Mimpi Yang Sempurna","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1279263,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Aqasha","original_name":"Aqasha","popularity":0.7359,"profile_path":"/9Gty2mAlGjGZeO63TpVQ5qDr9qa.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a75bb63c7c8739425335046","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1